gengge.care  # Domains appear to be used for trackers or cloakers related to gambling and investment scams. There is very little coverage of these domains in open source and they appear to be server side redirects. Visiting the sites directly will show no content. The gambling sites appear to target English speakers and are likely scams. Some domains are used for a client side SDK kit designed for aggressive push advertising.
